战斗狂热\" class=\"bili-tt\"><font color=\"#54b4db\">战斗狂热</font></span></span>]额外使自身造成伤害提高<font color=\"#ed7950\">2%</font>。\n</p>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<th class=\"text-nowrap\" style=\"width:20%;\">解放材料\n</th>\n<td class=\"wiki-bot text-left\" style=\"width:80%;\">\n<p>一级：20<img alt=\"虔爱之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/40px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/60px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/80px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" />，二级：60<img alt=\"虔爱之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/40px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/60px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/d/d4/jsnw0rhnzqmyac2anikbbk2gxdmgss3.png/80px-%E8%99%94%E7%88%B1%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"128\" data-file-height=\"128\" /> 20<img alt=\"守誓之徽.png\" src=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/dxcbmfcv31pm8tm7533rg36lf2azrpo.png/40px-%E5%AE%88%E8%AA%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"40\" height=\"40\" class=\"jndtb\" srcset=\"https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/dxcbmfcv31pm8tm7533rg36lf2azrpo.png/60px-%E5%AE%88%E8%AA%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 1.5x, https://patchwiki.biligame.com/images/llzj/thumb/8/8d/dxcbmfcv31pm8tm7533rg36lf2azrpo.png/80px-%E5%AE%88%E8%AA%93%E4%B9%8B%E5%BE%BD.png 2x\" data-fil